# area 59: the commando is woken, frozen with the dark beam (the frozen knock-back reaction's
# flags are 1|2 = 3), then killed, then hit again: the KnockBack override's dead arm, whose
# flags the forcing spec writes to 3.  The steps are wall times: under gdb the frames are slow.
@60 objs commando
@80 send u0417 Activate
@120 damage u0417 5 darkburst
@160 kill u0417
@200 damage u0417 5
@240 objs commando
